{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o026a","title":"刘备不忍弃南行百姓","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o026a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"有人劝速往江陵，刘备以众人归附、不忍舍弃为由不肯弃众。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o026a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"不弃众","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o026a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"当阳至江陵途中","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o026a-q"]},"time":{"year":208,"label":"南避曹军时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y208","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o024","basis":"南避曹军时"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o026a-q","xianzhu-q-o024","wudi-q-o119","wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c"]},"source_order":[32,111,"O026a"],"order":6532}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-888495d8be7766faf20c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":666,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0bae348fdb687025113d","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wudi-q-o119","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4bcffcc4ee709a4e5ea3","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。作玄武池以肄舟师〖2〗。﹝一﹞汉罢三公官，置丞相、御史大夫〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o026a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-83bc1d748ce31ad3ff64","layer":"original","quote":"或谓先主曰：“宜速行保江陵！今虽拥大众，被甲者少〖3〗；若曹公兵至，何以拒之？”先主曰：“夫济大事，必以人为本；今人归吾，吾何忍弃去！”﹝五﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o024","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c857386227851cc86ab3","layer":"original","quote":"（曹公南征表）〔及曹公南征〕，会表卒，﹝二﹞子琮代立〖2〗，遣使请降。先主屯樊，不知曹公猝至；至宛乃闻之，遂将其众去。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
